cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "python-gearbox: gear strength with ISO 6336 and AGMA 2001, and finite-element analysis of gear teeth"
abstract: >-
  Python library to check spur, helical, double helical and internal gear pairs against pitting
  and tooth root breakage with ISO 6336:2019 and AGMA 2001-D04, optimise profile shifts, export
  the tooth geometry to COMSOL, ABAQUS and ANSYS, and mesh and solve gear teeth with finite
  elements (Gmsh and CalculiX).
type: software
